WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.017
What if you miss a session?

2
00:00:02.418 --> 00:00:03.637
Life happens.

3
00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.257
I understand.

4
00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:06.955
If you miss a live session, you

5
00:00:06.955 --> 00:00:08.633
still have the program materials

6
00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.430
and the support, so you
can catch up.

7
00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:11.928
And your access to the program

8
00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:13.606
materials is lifetime, so you can

9
00:00:13.606 --> 00:00:15.644
come back to them whenever you
need them.

10
00:00:15.644 --> 00:00:17.621
The goal was never perfect
attendance.

11
00:00:17.821 --> 00:00:19.520
The goal is real growth.

12
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.978
Let's keep you moving forward.
